y 20%. Skilled in EDA, data cleaning, feature engineering, SQL, model evaluation, FastAPI and Docker. Seeking an Associate Data Scientist opportunity to apply analytical problem-solving, business-domain knowledge and practical ML/NLP experience.\n\nCORE SKILLS\n\nData & Analysis: Pandas, NumPy, Data Cleaning, Data Wrangling, EDA, Feature Engineering, Model Evaluation, Power BI', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('70e2c671-4714-4028-9a1c-ca95f269e949'), chunk_index=4, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190692, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='ML & DL: PyTorch, Scikit-Learn, XGBoost, Binary Classification, Regression, Hyperparameter Tuning (Optuna)\n\nData & Persistence: PostgreSQL, SQLAlchemy, Alembic, MongoDB, Pydantic, pydantic-settings\n\nNLP & LLMs: Transformers, BERT, RoBERTa, LoRA/PEFT, Seq2Seq, Multi-task Learning, NER, Text Classification, RAG\n\nRAG Stack: SentenceTransformers, ChromaDB, BM25, Dense and Lexical Retrieval, Hybrid Retrieval (RRF), Cross-Encoder Reranking, Recursive Chunking\n\nEvaluation Metrics: Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1, MRR, Precision@k, Recall@k, NDCG', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('90c7ad8d-52dc-420c-8ce4-d3e34b1586fe'), chunk_index=5, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190696, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='APIs & Deployment: FastAPI, Docker, Gradio, Streamlit, Ollama, Hugging Face Hub, REST APIs, Git/GitHub, MLFlow\n\nSoftware Design: Repository Pattern, Unit of Work (UoW), Dependency Injection\n\nLanguages & Developer Tools: Python, SQL, Bash/CLI, Linux, uv, Neovim, Power Apps, pytest, pytest-cov, Ruff, basedpyright, GNU Make\n\nDomain: Procure-to-Pay (P2P), Invoice Processing, Vendor Management, Audit & Compliance\n\nFEATURED PROJECTS\n\nIndustrial Copper Price & Lead Conversion Prediction | Python · XGBoost · Streamlit · Docker', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('17127313-5106-41a9-9cfe-f080c004d4bb'), chunk_index=6, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190700, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Built a dual-purpose ML system using regression for copper-price prediction and classification for lead-conversion prediction.\n\nEngineered 12 domain-specific features and applied SMOTETomek to address class imbalance.\n\nAchieved an F1 score of 0.99 for classification and an R² of 0.95 for regression on held-out test data.\n\nDeveloped an interactive Streamlit application and containerized it using Docker.', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d04979b9-30c3-4efa-adeb-dfc25d9db167'), chunk_index=7, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190704, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Airbnb Data Analysis & Dashboard | Python · Power BI · MongoDB Atlas · Streamlit · Docker\n\nAnalysed Airbnb listing data to identify pricing, availability, review and location trends across multiple cities.\n\nCleaned and transformed raw data, handled missing values and engineered features including price per guest and booking ratio.\n\nDeveloped an interactive Power BI dashboard with slicers and drill-through views for location, pricing and review analysis.', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('23b2b39c-e2e9-427a-9882-f64c6f6435bd'), chunk_index=8, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190708, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Stored and queried prepared listing data using MongoDB Atlas and developed a Streamlit interface for interactive exploration.\n\nIdentified insights that could support host pricing, availability and listing-performance decisions.\n\nContainerized the Streamlit application using Docker and published the project on GitHub.\n\nP2P Knowledge Hub (RAG System) — Domain Q&A over Finance Documents  |  PostgreSQL · ChromaDB · Sentence Transformers · Ollama · FastAPI', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('97bc556c-e0d7-4d91-99e9-6715f6078314'), chunk_index=9, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190712, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Building a production-oriented RAG system for answering Procure-to-Pay SOP, policy, invoice, purchasing, supplier and payment questions with grounded citations.\n\nImplemented PostgreSQL metadata persistence with SQLAlchemy and version-controlled database schema migrations using Alembic.\n\nImplemented document ingestion, metadata collection, SHA-256 duplicate detection, recursive chunking and SentenceTransformer embeddings.\n\nCombined BM25 lexical retrieval and ChromaDB dense retrieval using hybrid fusion, followed by Cross-Encoder reranking.', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c87a8eb3-e97d-494f-8a83-ffb7d593f69b'), chunk_index=10, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190716, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Implemented deterministic Python citation resolution so document names, sections, page numbers and source links remain outside the LLM’s control.\n\nAdded FastAPI document and query operations, local Ollama/Qwen3 generation and stage-level latency profiling.\n\nCurrent status: active local development and end-to-end experimentation.\n\nTicketIQ — Multi-Task NLP Classifier  |  RoBERTa-base · LoRA/PEFT · PyTorch · FastAPI · Docker · HuggingFace', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('93dd7908-8f6d-48fa-a894-3e2d91e04792'), chunk_index=11, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190719, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Fine-tuned RoBERTa-base with LoRA (PEFT) using three classification heads: category, priority, and sentiment — achieving combined weighted F1 of 0.836 on Customer support ticket data.\n\nBuilt an end-to-end training and serving pipeline: training → FastAPI REST API → Gradio UI → Docker deployment → Hugging Face model card.\n\nDemonstrates efficient parameter fine-tuning (LoRA) — trainable params under 1% of full model size, production-deployable on CPU.', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2d8db610-ff9b-4d64-acda-61dfe25328c8'), chunk_index=12, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190723, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Model published on HuggingFace under San-Analytics. GitHub README includes architecture diagram, metrics, and usage examples.\n\nAlso built: P2P Intelligence — P2P document classifier and NER system (FastAPI) · BERT NER model fine-tuned on FewNERD (published on HuggingFace) · DistilBERT sentiment classifier (SST-2) · English→Tamil Transformer from scratch (14.2M params, SentencePiece BPE) · Churn Prediction ANN (PyTorch + Optuna)\n\nWORK EXPERIENCE', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('54950cd7-d9d6-4441-9834-bbecf445e734'), chunk_index=13, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190727, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Senior Analyst — Procure-to-Pay (Team Lead)  —  Accenture Solutions Pvt. Ltd | April 2016 – Present\n\nLeading a 4-member Special P2P operations team handling end-to-end invoice processing, vendor management, and audit compliance for enterprise clients — developing deep domain expertise now applied to building AI systems for the same processes.', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('029ec0a8-dcbb-45d7-8e00-0d702b7ad717'), chunk_index=14, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190731, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Identified process inefficiencies and built Power Apps automation solutions that reduced manual effort by 20% and introduced real-time audit trails — early applied AI/automation work that directly motivated the transition to ML engineering.\n\nBuilt Power BI dashboards connecting live operational data to management reporting, automating workflows previously handled manually.\n\nDomain knowledge of P2P lifecycle (PO creation → GRN → invoice matching → payment → reconciliation)', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('64518710-cf9a-4e1d-8742-272222a3801d'), chunk_index=15, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190734, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Junior Accounts Executive  —  Apex Laboratories Pvt. Ltd | July 2015 – April 2016\n\nManaged accounts payable, reconciliation, and vendor communication in a pharmaceutical manufacturing environment.\n\nAccounts Assistant  —  East Coast Constructions & Industries Ltd | November 2013 – June 2015\n\nSupported accounts team with transaction processing and financial reporting.\n\nEDUCATION & CERTIFICATIONS\n\nData Science Certification  —  GUVI / IIT Madras Research Park  (Apr 2024)', page_no=None, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6844de04-01c2-4a35-8bdf-74119b661ddb'), chunk_index=16, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('903aaf4f-44ef-4c17-b6b1-8d387a0ae00e'), document_group_id=UUID('fa55cb94-67ed-4ed7-a19a-3d153e1897b9'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 24, 19, 36, 29, 190738, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='B.Com  —  K.C.S. Kasi Nadar College, Madras University  (Apr 2013)', page_no=None, section=None, title=None)]
